*PPD-Adobe: "4.3"
*FormatVersion: "4.3"
*FileVersion: "1.0"
*LanguageVersion: English
*LanguageEncoding: ISOLatin1
*PCFileName: "METAPRN.PPD"
*Manufacturer: "MetaPrinter"
*Product: "(MetaPrinter)"
*cupsVersion: 1.1
*cupsManualCopies: True
*cupsModelNumber: 0
*cupsLanguages: "en"
*ModelName: "MetaPrinter"
*ShortNickName: "MetaPrinter"
*NickName: "Meta Printer, metadata-injecting CUPS filter"
*PSVersion: "(3010.000) 0"
*LanguageLevel: "3"
*ColorDevice: False
*DefaultColorSpace: Gray
*FileSystem: False
*Throughput: "8"
*LandscapeOrientation: Plus90
*VariablePaperSize: False
*TTRasterizer: Type42

*% ---- Supported input formats ----------------------------------------
*% metafilter accepts PDF, PostScript and office/text documents (DOCX,
*% ODT, DOC, RTF, plain text). PDF/PostScript are re-emitted in the same
*% format with metadata overlaid/prepended; office and text documents are
*% converted to PDF with the metadata inserted into a real Writer header
*% (requires LibreOffice + python3-uno on the print server).
*cupsFilter2: "application/pdf application/pdf 0 metafilter"
*cupsFilter2: "application/postscript application/postscript 0 metafilter"
*cupsFilter2: "text/plain application/pdf 100 metafilter"
*cupsFilter2: "application/msword application/pdf 100 metafilter"
*cupsFilter2: "application/rtf application/pdf 100 metafilter"
*cupsFilter2: "application/vnd.oasis.opendocument.text application/pdf 100 metafilter"
*cupsFilter2: "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document application/pdf 100 metafilter"

*% ---- Page sizes -----------------------------------------------------
*OpenUI *PageSize/Media Size: PickOne
*DefaultPageSize: A4
*PageSize A4/A4: "<</PageSize [595 842] /ImagingBBox null>> setpagedevice"
*PageSize Letter/US Letter: "<</PageSize [612 792] /ImagingBBox null>> setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageSize

*OpenUI *PageRegion: PickOne
*DefaultPageRegion: A4
*PageRegion A4/A4: "<</PageSize [595 842] /ImagingBBox null>> setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Letter/US Letter: "<</PageSize [612 792] /ImagingBBox null>> setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageRegion

*DefaultImageableArea: A4
*ImageableArea A4/A4: "0 0 595 842"
*ImageableArea Letter/US Letter: "0 0 612 792"

*DefaultPaperDimension: A4
*PaperDimension A4/A4: "595 842"
*PaperDimension Letter/US Letter: "612 792"

*% ---- Resolution -----------------------------------------------------
*OpenUI *Resolution/Output Resolution: PickOne
*DefaultResolution: 600dpi
*Resolution 300dpi/300 DPI: "<</HWResolution [300 300]>> setpagedevice"
*Resolution 600dpi/600 DPI: "<</HWResolution [600 600]>> setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *Resolution

*% EOF
